  "description": "A discussion forum that runs inside your Umbraco 17 site. Boards are Umbraco content; threads and posts live in the package's own tables. Includes a moderation rules engine, a moderation queue on the website for members of a Moderators group, search, SEO markup and a guided installer. Optional AI review via DigitalWonderlab.CommunityAi. Free to use.",
